<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Korea Zinc first half net surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Korea Zinc first half net surges.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     408 vs  84</p>
<p>    Net					    7.01 vs 1.42</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 10.08 vs 1.93</p>
<p>    Turnover				   301.36 vs 242.59</p>
<p>Note - Korea Zinc Co Ltd is South Korea's largest zinc producer. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
